  "22:11": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young woman in <Picture 1>, Tifa Lockhart from Final Fantasy VII: slender athletic build, long dark brown hair falling past her waist and tied at the tips, red eyes, a short black crop top under a white tank top, black suspenders, a short black skirt, red-brown fingerless leather gloves with metal plates, and tall black boots.\n<Subject 2> is the rain-slicked slum alley in <Picture 2>, with rusted corrugated walls, stacked scrap crates, hanging cables and a flickering neon sign, lit by cold blue-green light with orange sparks.\n<Subject 3> is the Shinra soldier in <Picture 3>, a trooper in a full dark-blue armored uniform with a rounded helmet and a glowing green visor, carrying a heavy automatic rifle.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1> fighting <Subject 3> inside <Subject 2> in a fast, heavily cut action sequence, dodging, striking and throwing him back, then facing the camera with a teasing smile while an off-screen voice, her own, taunts him.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - face, long dark hair, outfit, gloves and boots are retained in every shot, including in close-ups and in motion.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - rusted walls, crates, cables and flickering neon are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - dark-blue armor, rounded helmet and green visor are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a cinematic action-game cutscene style, with high-contrast cold blue-green lighting cut by orange sparks, shallow depth of field, crisp motion and a polished 3D-render look. The sequence is cut rapidly, each shot lasting about one to two seconds, with hard cuts that keep the fighters' positions and screen direction consistent.\n[Shot 1] A wide low-angle shot frames <Subject 2>, the wet slum alley. <Subject 3> charges from the left, rifle raised, as <Subject 1> slips sideways in a low fighting stance, fists up, her hair swinging behind her.\n[Shot 2] At 00:01.500, a tight medium shot from the side: <Subject 1> ducks under the swing of the rifle butt and drives a sharp rising punch into the armor of <Subject 3>, sparks bursting at the impact, her expression focused and fierce.\n[Shot 3] At 00:02.800, a close-up on the boots of <Subject 1> as she spins and lands a powerful roundhouse kick to the chest of <Subject 3>, whose body is thrown backward, the camera whipping to follow the motion.\n[Shot 4] At 00:04.000, a wide handheld shot: <Subject 3> crashes into the stacked crates of <Subject 2>, scattering them across the wet ground, while <Subject 1> lands lightly in the foreground with her back to the camera, then rolls her shoulders.\n[Shot 5] At 00:05.500, a medium close-up with a slow push-in: <Subject 1> turns toward the camera, hair settling, one gloved fist raised, a confident teasing smile on her face. An off-screen voice (S1), a young woman's voice, playful, bright and confident, native French speaker, speaking at a lively pace with a mocking lilt, says, <d>[French] Essaie encore, haha !</d>\n\noverall_soundscape:\nHeavy rain and the buzz of the flickering neon throughout, sharp impacts of punches and kicks synchronized with each cut, the clatter of crates falling in Shot 4, and a metallic ring of the rifle on stone.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA driving, fast-paced orchestral-rock battle theme with pounding drums and electric guitar, cutting off abruptly on the final hit of Shot 4 and leaving a short silence before the line in Shot 5."
